# Cortex — paths that are NOT knowledge (noise). The single source of truth: every generator and
# the /audit ritual reads THIS file. Add a line to keep something out of the graph/navigator.
# Trailing slash = a directory anywhere; otherwise a filename or *.glob (matched on the basename).
.git/
node_modules/
.claude/
.agents/
.superpowers/
.vscode/
docs/
archives/
templates/
tools/
skills/

# The code packages and the subagent definitions. Source, not vault knowledge — the same reason
# tools/ and skills/ are above. Excluding them also removes an id collision: note ids are slugs of
# the BASENAME, so four AGENTS.md files all claimed the id `agents` and a [[AGENTS]] link resolved
# to whichever the walker reached first.
core/
index/
mcp/
agents/

# Generated by the codebase half. .cortex/memory/ is deliberately NOT here: it is authored
# knowledge (ADR 0002), so a memory note nothing links is a real orphan, not viewer noise.
.cortex/index/
.cortex/findings/
.cortex/view/
.backups/
*.example.md
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
*.chatprompt.md
*.html
